{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "4aa2b1f79fce4385f34251b3dbb16e3ddbdc368dcdabbabe87e069111da5c4de", "ja": "新しい風", "zh": "崭新的风潮", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "534621295f87485a08ab1628daeec3897dc6222dec817647c61d2d20370e3abc", "ja": "新たなユニット結成を任された\nプロデューサー。社長からのお題は\n『爽やかな春の風』。\n楽しそうに会話するエレナと美也を見て、\n2人をデュオにする事を思いつく。", "zh": "制作人接下了成立新团体的指令。\n社长给的题目是\n『爽朗春风』。\n看到艾琳娜与美也相谈甚欢的样子，\n制作人决定安排她们组成双人组。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "746edfb6897728a58953282038a96054a8b63f3f8f3cb6d3d4f36c6c3171682b", "ja": "（テーマは『爽やかな春の風』、か……。\nあたたかくて、優しくて……となると……ん？）", "zh": "（主题是『爽朗春风』……\n温暖、柔和的感觉……这样的话……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b8fa5b5e4b46a868749023036603e40d64bfe50b763599a4e9cf5f30560ecb43", "ja": "ねーねー茜ちゃん。茜ちゃんいちおう、高校生だよね？\n高校って、どんなカンジなんですか～？", "zh": "欸欸，小茜，你算是高中生对吧？\n高中是怎样的地方呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "8dcfb581689ee72583ccc2b95df80bdbef516b8f00bd08472db69ef25bfcfa37", "ja": "いちおうも何も、茜ちゃんは正真正銘の女子高生！\nJKだよ翼ちゃん！　それはさておき、高校か～。", "zh": "什么算是，小茜就是货真价实的女高中生！\n是JK喔，小翼！回到正题，高中啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d66b8f1c92428c47373759fb71d5ac502a9e2c9584d1f064889497c61633d227", "ja": "だって中学とはいろいろ違うんでしょ？\n部活もゆるそうだし、あとは学食があったり～……。", "zh": "跟国中是不是差很多啊？\n社团好像比较悠闲，还有学生餐厅之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "093e65af81399f3a2d997aa654ff8e874c186259f69c2125554b658503288a3a", "ja": "なになに、茜の高校の話？\nミキも、ちょっと興味あるかも。", "zh": "什么什么，你们在聊茜的高中？\n美希也有点兴趣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "0983c476e978d26043dc20ff169c630e732cc984eb2c9afe9786d94607f389c1", "ja": "茜ちゃんの場合はだけど、中学の時とは、\nちょっと違うよね～。自由っていうか？", "zh": "这只是小茜自己的感想，跟国中比起来，\n的确有点不同呢～应该说比较自由吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a3f6bad63ead6ed1456e5a1700629c805a4f1734956503a3f7d0c6df703d0bbc", "ja": "（それは茜が自由なだけなんじゃ……\nいや、ここで突っ込むのはやめておこう）", "zh": "（我看是茜自己活得很随心所欲吧……\n不，还是别在这吐槽好了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "7a08fc6aba4b2f1803b93129724b83d49cf87b1a6c6a4a1183703a7ef5169861", "ja": "中学の時と違うのは、テストが容赦ないってコトかな！\n茜ちゃんの学校も、休み明けにテストがあるけど……。", "zh": "跟国中不一样的地方，大概是考试很严格吧！\n小茜的学校会在假期结束后安排考试……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "a03df97a23ffef35671138be1970b066c162f304a8aef81f23db6c7270ec8693", "ja": "赤点、それはすなわち死！　点を取らなければ追試、\nそれすらも落とせば、単位がもらえず落第……！", "zh": "考不及格，等同宣告死刑！分数不够高就要补考，\n连补考都没过的话，就拿不到学分，准备留级……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a342bfeec61cc7f5da2ecfd6f1b532fb8e71b94866262ecdf9b41e7d1f25596f", "ja": "落第って、進級できないってことですよね？\n大変～！", "zh": "留级，就是不能升上高年级对吧？\n我的天啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "aa5952a74d0dfb9af061024ab8a7cde545c08ae3c798e24024abe37459f62e54", "ja": "でもそれって、茜が\n赤点を取らなきゃいいだけじゃない？", "zh": "不过，只要茜\n考试有及格不就行了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "308faf50477c0fb0a7fd93ecf7037c0873c39ce061ef33700b4314d09ca1c345", "ja": "美希ちゃん！　それは言わない約束だよ！", "zh": "小美希！说好不提这个的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "06bb15ab1380d9de0f98f50fa01ad16b6f7ee04ff288fc0d21f72229538934fc", "ja": "ミキ、約束なんてしてないよ？", "zh": "美希才没跟你说好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "b8d598c2826db21135f41eab0012535aef8aab31eb70d7e6458ffe44e2694349", "ja": "（茜の赤点については、後で詳しく聞くとして……。\nみんな、それぞれ学生生活を楽しんでるんだな）", "zh": "（小茜的成绩问题，等等再来问个详细好了……\n大家都有在享受自己的校园生活呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1014_p", "source_sha256": "c2e3553a259b24ae97026fc6681d7ed3ea6aba15dd6a96b788a8a8652d81f405", "ja": "（おや？　あそこにいるのは……エレナと、美也か？\n何をしているんだろう）", "zh": "（咦？那边两位是……艾琳娜跟美也？\n她们在做什么啊？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "60f92cbe557c93db96aebc9ba4c1b28c1bd6fc136faf3344d5773a7798203ebc", "ja": "じゃあ、次の問題に行くネっ！　メソポタミアを\n統一した王様は、誰でしょう？　ヒントは……。", "zh": "那么，下一题来啰！请问统一美索不达米亚的\n国王是谁？提示……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "173da716825c54b4656a079553a90a8dc08a5577be227896a25bad2fc8e0c63a", "ja": "目には目をー！　歯には歯をー！", "zh": "以眼还眼──！以牙还牙──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1017_042miy", "source_sha256": "c13601390bc790c6aefd54bf6070fb90bd10765f43fd6d8ec532284692cb2aae", "ja": "そのことわざは、知っています～。\n答えは、ハンムラビさん、ですね～。", "zh": "我知道这个谚语～\n答案是，汉摩拉比先生，对不对～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1018_p", "source_sha256": "827b969aa544ff657b09896e56b521fcf1a55dcae2dcbbf8d44d29e1f194907b", "ja": "（俺の記憶が正しければ、ハンムラビ法典は\nことわざではないはずだが……まぁいいか）", "zh": "（我没记错的话，汉摩拉比法典\n应该不是谚语才对……算了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1019_018ele", "source_sha256": "e5056b80f30bd7e82a32c44ed1d8645e2ac700b315060b5cacf10ad99ee5c237", "ja": "ピンポーン！　大正解だヨー！", "zh": "叮咚──！答对了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1020_042miy", "source_sha256": "e130f9a315cea0575fc2438ac3ef72f08def499a8021f6cb60ebbed4182330d2", "ja": "おお～、やりました～。\nハンムラビさんは、すごいですね～。", "zh": "喔喔～太好了～\n汉摩拉比先生很厉害呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1021_018ele", "source_sha256": "8148c057db4d89032b0dce98a8e361e05fa622d5409ad5b83cb2e4d11afe424f", "ja": "ワタシも王様になりたいナ♪　エレナ法典には、\n『毎日サンバをすること』って書くヨ～！", "zh": "我也好想当国王喔♪\n我要在艾琳娜法典里写『每天都要跳森巴』～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1022_042miy", "source_sha256": "019e6aaa82101cab99c1bdf53cd4d60d73e09a90ef3489692a42dd7c77b4c9f6", "ja": "それは素敵な法律ですね～。\nきっと、毎日がお祭りみたいで楽しいですよ～。", "zh": "这条法律听起来真棒～\n感觉每天都像在过节一样开心～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1023_p", "source_sha256": "08049acfdda4a1792b73c892e1bbb1e9b307bf3d577e2a0bb80c08cb8d916c73", "ja": "（クイズかと思ったら、テスト勉強をしてるのか。\nそういえばふたりは、同い年だったな）", "zh": "（我还以为是在猜谜，原来是在复习考试啊。\n说起来她们学年也一样呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "73c9c39f7175d823a88482a1008a37096db755e824452e7ac75da04b6ed16074", "ja": "茜、テストが近いんだろ？\n不安なら、エレナ達と一緒に勉強したらどうだ？", "zh": "茜，学校快要考试了吧？\n你会担心的话，要不要跟艾琳娜她们一起念书？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1025_023aka", "source_sha256": "51b3add12e408ea021ba5a7199896e1feaffcf27447378490791686205818dec", "ja": "も～、{$P$}ちゃん。\nエレナちゃんと美也ちゃんは、高2でしょ？", "zh": "真是的～小{$P$}。\n小艾琳跟小美可是高二啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1026_023aka", "source_sha256": "7bb8e8580c37ad3e6bdc374aee9b59bc60a0a2b228a572d92031bbf3410feb8e", "ja": "高校の1年には、見た目よりすごい差があるんだよ！\n{$P$}ちゃんには昔話だろうけど！", "zh": "高中一年的差距，可比外表上要来得多！\n虽然这对小{$P$}而言都是往事了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1027_p", "source_sha256": "cb644146463551785367e42e78a8157181303bb759c82f451edf6d7f2974e42e", "ja": "昔話で悪かったな。確かにテスト範囲も\n違うだろうけど、教えてもらうくらいなら……。", "zh": "我年纪大抱歉吼。考试的范围确实不同，\n但你有不懂的可以请教她们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1028_018ele", "source_sha256": "77d41e5c0a46fe9caa6169a56353fcf2536670b6709ce30d9f6c8957f90e4441", "ja": "なになに？　アカネ、ワタシに何を教えて欲しいノ？\nあっ、わかった！　ダンスだネ♪", "zh": "什么什么？茜，你有事想请教我吗？\n啊，我知道了！是跳舞的事对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1029_018ele", "source_sha256": "65277dc7215e7bc245336f22e9fb85885e6a0b77b6efddefab4c9a298991fe29", "ja": "いいヨ、ダンスならいつでも教えてあげるヨー！", "zh": "没问题，我随时都能教你跳舞喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1030_023aka", "source_sha256": "62163d1aed5ed84eb9cd512d08f5585968d68004cc21efc9a3619d79bbc4bb66", "ja": "違う！　エレナちゃん、違うからね！？", "zh": "不是！小艾琳，你别误会啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1031_042miy", "source_sha256": "4c9f9f7d22b78267477ebfbfe74fa9ab8401f89f9e11a1e556aacb1b354e3592", "ja": "うふふ、なんだか楽しいですね～。\n部活みたいです～。", "zh": "呵呵，感觉好开心喔～\n就像在玩社团一样～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1032_p", "source_sha256": "36af8bc2ed8dd42709c2d7f6079d6c0713cddc2626bb2fa4eb7739ffe6040117", "ja": "部活か……。", "zh": "社团啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1033_p", "source_sha256": "927eaacfbeb7d55a54d02c5c67255e554c0d0609b8bb5e3c9fe0037073a251de", "ja": "（しかし、美也とエレナが一緒に勉強してるというのは\n意外だな。性格的には正反対に見えるんだが……）", "zh": "（不过，看到美也跟艾琳娜一起念书\n还真让人意外。她们俩的个性应该恰恰相反……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1034_p", "source_sha256": "62041998b66171474365980610b9b764bca29704c0c1c670c16c882759066987", "ja": "お疲れさま、エレナ、美也。\nテスト勉強か？　感心だな！", "zh": "辛苦了，艾琳娜、美也。\n在复习考试吗？真了不起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1035_018ele", "source_sha256": "ee020a4da96ddefb838f9312e96214c8abb87dd205e6af9f1f584cee98745fa1", "ja": "{$P$}！\nうん、そうなんだヨ。", "zh": "{$P$}！\n嗯，没有错喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1036_042miy", "source_sha256": "809e183b25b6e3adecd23b4977a5336b19902ce93a8ac00570b59016e70ca9d2", "ja": "私達ふたりで、教えあいっこしてたんですよ～。", "zh": "我们两个正在教彼此不懂的地方呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1037_018ele", "source_sha256": "cc8bbc1d9228994ea5823ab5bfa346410ec95cf47a8157daf13dca4a8c3443d1", "ja": "ワタシ達、今度のテストで1番取っちゃうかもだヨ～？\nなんちゃって！", "zh": "我们下次考试说不定会是第一名呢～！\n开玩笑的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1038_042miy", "source_sha256": "d62f692e3a5b8f9f3d51564f69442d2b3a7b3b63c411436b4b0e33c19348ca96", "ja": "むふふ。\nふたりで1番が取れたら、素敵ですね～。", "zh": "呵呵呵。\n要是两个人一起考第一，那一定很棒～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1039_p", "source_sha256": "370fc0bd19dbb3879337c6fdb49c90b7c934474c13be59ed464f918a61cd85ff", "ja": "部活、それに勉強か……。\nうん、青春っぽくていいな。爽やかだ。", "zh": "社团，还有学业啊……\n嗯，这样青春的感觉真不错，很爽朗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1040_p", "source_sha256": "ab9750cfeb192264ed32dfcd055d64d267f3856d7ab7a80fb1c65dd84bdc57f3", "ja": "……そうだ。せっかく春なんだから、\n青春をテーマにすればいいんじゃないかな？", "zh": "……对了，既然是春天，\n那以青春当主题不是很好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1041_018ele", "source_sha256": "e6d60b622bd8e7bef3cb1bfbdaf6bb0a28a996dc5dd3876f70e3dcd65973ffbe", "ja": "？　{$P$}、さっきからブツブツ\n言って、どうしたノ？　テーマって、何の話？", "zh": "嗯？{$P$}，你从刚刚就一直\n自言自语，怎么了吗？主题是指什么事情？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1042_042miy", "source_sha256": "db5d7ac93eba52acbf6c4a031570358140f39f0eedb2ad7a78db11e900a0545c", "ja": "{$P$}さんにも、\n何か宿題があるんでしょうか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生也有\n什么作业吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1043_p", "source_sha256": "cdb9b734f24597d4b6520fadd2512efe68702b4b7f8b5163a6f8e89e3c6a8c1d", "ja": "ああ、そうなんだ。社長から、宿題をするように\n言われてたんだけど……今思いついたよ。", "zh": "嗯，有喔。社长交代我要写功课……\n我刚刚想到要怎么写了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1044_p", "source_sha256": "d47febfe27dafc0d3ea8817e57482d1099a31f5547ea5f25bb211b58142f915c", "ja": "美也、エレナ。\nふたりで、ユニットを組んでみないか？", "zh": "美也、艾琳娜。\n你们两个要不要试着组团体？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1045_018ele", "source_sha256": "195b4c631a540f096dd5fa1179512d1fa0b96cc0853c1c7c6667813da59d0290", "ja": "ユニット……？", "zh": "团体……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1046_042miy", "source_sha256": "8fe53c359f12bfa39c283f018f85752afc0e9c8a1b629fc1cd9834fc7825be2c", "ja": "私達ふたりだけ、ですか～？", "zh": "只有我们两个吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1047_p", "source_sha256": "9b17916f3ece2dc8ae5214aad44cc0ba10863845bcbfe4a139eb5f574f5cd468", "ja": "うん。春の爽やかさ、青春、女子高生……\nふたりなら、きっとぴったりだと思うんだ。", "zh": "嗯。春天般的爽朗、青春、女高中生……\n我觉得你们俩非常契合主题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1048_023aka", "source_sha256": "74536fd695c761abdfffa400d763700de86a80aae70d5cd420a9e90691ba70ec", "ja": "ちょっと待ったー！　{$P$}ちゃん、\nそれは聞き捨てならないよ！？", "zh": "等一下──！小{$P$}，\n这话小茜可不能当作没听到喔！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1049_023aka", "source_sha256": "11a0d8b43cc3ce3dd1bf61af392d915e192c45501baf52e9b3f34594453150dd", "ja": "女子高生なら！　ここにも！　いるのに！", "zh": "要找女高中生！这里也有！不是吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1050_p", "source_sha256": "40d67e6e4f91ac5e27b9ec60b631dcac839be3644440792d3481e154dd2dc0f5", "ja": "茜は、今回のイメージと違……いや、秘密兵器なんだ。\nだからまた今度な！", "zh": "茜的形象不太符合这次的主……呃不，你是秘密武器。\n所以下次再说吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1051_023aka", "source_sha256": "f8a6baad327efb6d1623457de176bf3ad72e94cd3ef96caa4adc2c0b15572dbe", "ja": "秘密兵器……！　そっか、それじゃ仕方ないね。\n今回はエレナちゃんと美也ちゃんに譲るよ！", "zh": "秘密武器……！这样啊，那没办法了。\n这次就让给小艾琳跟小美也吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1052_p", "source_sha256": "00ff1429f43993e74a0c56c31b7a383e5592cf9f20ad70c2f6f6dddbc5a448e7", "ja": "うん。……それじゃ美也、エレナ。\n頼んだぞ！", "zh": "嗯。\n……那么美也、艾琳娜，拜托你们啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1053_018ele", "source_sha256": "e9c9ccb847b62c91c032be1372eff20be8babf6148ca4370e4419fcbe46d4219", "ja": "ハーイ！", "zh": "好的──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0023_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0023_story_01_1054_042miy", "source_sha256": "259b1273383b0bdb6edb79df720a6038b50ad1640d625fdd6249182573293172", "ja": "はい～。", "zh": "好的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
